  "fullDescription": "Bring the nostalgic beauty of pressed petals into your artwork with Aamo’s Dried Flower Collage collection. This set includes 12 high-resolution digital papers featuring artistic collages of dried flowers arranged on textured backgrounds — perfect for vintage, botanical, and handmade-style creations.\n\nGreat for junk journals, scrapbooking, vintage invites, printable crafts, and soft natural branding. Each background blends aged textures with delicately placed blooms, evoking the charm of timeless florals 🌸🍂📜\n\nWhat’s Included:\n✔️ 12 PNG Files\n✔️ Size: 12″ x 12″ (3600 x 3600 pixels)\n✔️ High Resolution – 300 DPI\n✔️ Dried Flower Collage Style\n✔️ Opaque (Non-Transparent) Backgrounds\n\nPerfect For:\n• Junk Journals & Ephemera\n• Scrapbooking Projects\n• Vintage-Inspired Crafts\n• Floral Branding & Packaging\n• Printable Wall Art",
